Package: jpmapdata
Title: Boundary Data for Japan Maps
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Yusaku", "Horiuchi", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "yusaku.horiuchi@gmail.com")
URL: https://github.com/yhoriuchi/jpmapdata
BugReports: https://github.com/yhoriuchi/jpmapdata/issues
Description: Provides boundary 'GeoPackage' files used by the 'jpmap' package,
    including Japan prefecture example boundaries and official MLIT N03
    administrative area data converted for 'jpmap'. Keeping these data in a
    separate package lets 'jpmap' update its functionality without repeatedly
    redistributing large boundary files on CRAN mirrors.
